sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Staff as Staff / Customer
  participant BFF as BFF<br/>Payment edge
  participant Payment as Payment<br/>owner
  participant Order as Order<br/>bill/session owner
  participant Sepay as SePay / Bank
  participant Kafka as Kafka<br/>payment.completed

  Staff->>BFF: Pay by cash or request VietQR
  BFF->>Payment: Verified payment command
  Payment->>Order: Read payable bill snapshot
  Order-->>Payment: Status and rounded total

  alt Cash
    Payment->>Payment: Commit PAID cash<br/>audit + outbox
    Payment->>Order: Mark bill paid
  else VietQR / SePay
    Payment-->>BFF: QR payload + QRTBL reference
    BFF-->>Staff: Display VietQR
    Staff->>Sepay: Bank transfer with bill reference
    Sepay->>BFF: SePay webhook
    BFF->>Payment: Webhook payload
    Payment->>Payment: Validate secret, reference and amount
    Payment->>Order: Mark bill paid if valid
  end

  Payment-->>BFF: Payment result
  BFF-->>Staff: Show result
  Payment-->>Kafka: Publish payment.completed after commit

  Note over Payment,Order: Payment owns payment records and audit logs<br/>Order owns bill, session and table finalization
